---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Thank You – B&G Engineering"
  description="Thank you page for B&G Engineering contact and quote request forms."
>
  <section class="hero compact">
    <p class="eyebrow">Thank you</p>
    <h1>The submission flow is currently in test mode.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      This page confirms that the form route no longer leads to an error. Final email
      notification, D1 data storage, R2 file storage and Turnstile protection will be connected in a later backend phase.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section thank-you-card">
    <div class="note-box form-status-box">
      <strong>MVP / test status:</strong> the form currently does not send data to a server,
      does not write to a database and does not upload files. The Cloudflare backend must be connected before live use.
    </div>

    <h2>What does this mean now?</h2>
    <ul class="check-list">
      <li>The quote request and contact form flow can be tested.</li>
      <li>The visitor is taken to a controlled confirmation page.</li>
      <li>The file upload place is prepared, but not active yet.</li>
      <li>Real incoming quote requests will be handled in the next backend phase.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="button-row">
      <a class="button" href="/en/request-quote/">Back to request quote</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/en/contact/">Contact page</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
